OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Chancellor's attempts to
OL,4,Aboost vibes may limit tax rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor may have thought about
OL,7,Fshifting the venue of his first major
OL,8,Fspeech this morning.
OL,10,FIt was an absolute and total
OL,11,Fcoincidence that he chose to make it in
OL,12,Fthe Coventry Manufacturing and
OL,13,FTechnology Centre (MTC), just a few
OL,14,Fminute's drive from the city's totemic
OL,15,FHQ of Jaguar Land Rover (JLR).
OL,17,FIn the event, no one was pulling
OL,18,Fpunches. The 4,000 office-based job
OL,19,Flosses at JLR were confirmed as John
OL,20,FHealey answered questions a few miles
OL,21,Faway.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
